; Scheme declarations for the configs beside this file.
;
; Kept in one file so a finding can be read against the rule that raised it: [$weapon] is strict and
; therefore refuses an undeclared field and demands every non-optional one, [$ammo] is not and only
; judges the fields it names, and [$upgrade_grid] declares `*` so a section of arbitrary keys is still
; typed.

[$weapon]
$strict = true
cost = u32
ammo_class = string[]
kind = enum:pistol,rifle,shotgun
upgrade_scheme = ?section
description = ?string

[$ammo]
cost = u32
box_size = u8

[$upgrade_grid]
$strict = true
* = u32
